{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","神锋裂地"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","挥舞长枪朝一个方向持续行军。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，以华丽无双的枪法向该方向行军3格。在此过程中，珀尔修斯会对周围1格范围内的敌人造成11次85% + 10% ATK伤害，并且持续将敌人向自身行进方向击退。行军完毕后，珀尔修斯会释放一次盾牌猛击，对周围1格内的所有敌人造成280% + 30% ATK伤害和2秒眩晕。珀尔修斯在本技能释放期间霸体。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":121,"end":127,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":117,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":151,"end":153,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","行军期间伤害提升至90% + 10% ATK，盾牌猛击伤害提升至290% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","行军期间伤害提升至95% + 10% ATK，盾牌猛击伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","行军期间伤害提升至100% + 10% ATK，盾牌猛击伤害提升至310% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","行军期间伤害提升至105% + 10% ATK，盾牌猛击伤害提升至320% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","枪盾连击"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","挥舞枪盾，对附近敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","用枪盾分别挥舞一周攻击附近敌人。舞枪时对附近1格范围内敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，舞盾时对附近1格范围敌人造成140% + 10% ATK伤害，并获得360% ATK加上此次伤害量80%的护盾，持续6秒。该护盾持续期间，自身攻击速度提高35点。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":66,"end":72,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":62,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":82,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","舞枪伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK，舞盾伤害提升至150% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","舞枪伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK，舞盾伤害提升至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","舞枪伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK，舞盾伤害提升至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","丰饶之地"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为丰饶之地中的友军提供增益。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","珀尔修斯尚未承受严重伤害时，其周围1格范围内的土地会变成丰饶之地。丰饶之地中的友军提高14.5% + 1.5%攻击力、19% + 2.5%护甲与魔抗。当珀尔修斯的生命值首次低于初始最大生命值的40%时，将会汲取大地的力量，使自身的生命上限永久提高60% + 6%并恢复等量生命值，但丰饶之地也会随之永久消失。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":62,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":126,"end":131,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","丰饶之地中友军的增益提升至15.5% + 1.5%攻击力和21% + 2.5%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":32,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","丰饶之地中友军的增益提升至16.5% + 1.5%攻击力和23% + 2.5%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":32,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","丰饶之地中友军的增益提升至17.5% + 1.5%攻击力和25% + 2.5%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":32,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升，获得非永久属性增益后则进一步提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升9%，拥有来自其他友军的非永久属性增益效果时额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升12%，拥有来自其他友军的非永久属性增益效果时额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升15%，拥有来自其他友军的非永久属性增益效果时额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","神光庇佑"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得属性增益时自身获得额外强化效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","珀尔修斯受到丰饶之力的眷顾。当自身获得非永久属性提升效果时，会使该属性提升量额外提高20%。并且每个来自其他不同友军的非永久属性增益效果都会使自身造成的伤害提高15%、受到的伤害降低15%，该效果最多叠加4层。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","当自身获得非永久属性提升效果时，会使该属性提升量额外提高30%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当自身同时拥有2个来自其他不同友军的非永久属性提升效果时，珀尔修斯造成的伤害将转化为真实伤害，并且自身获得霸体。该效果每次触发至少持续6秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","当自身获得非永久属性提升效果时，会使该属性提升量额外提高40%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","丰饶之地范围扩大。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","丰饶之地的半径扩大1格。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","丰饶长枪"]]}